<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman upgrades Chevron.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman upgrades Chevron.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst William Randol upgraded Chevron Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The move was based on considerations of the stock's valuation and a more positive outlook on Chevron's growth in international oil and gas production, a Lehman report said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/8 at 66-1/4.</p>
</text>
